# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify SPA fallback.
#
# Real files win: Pages serves an asset if one exists at the path and only
# falls through to this rule when nothing matches, so this cannot swallow
# /assets, /models, /cars and friends the way it looks like it might.
#
# 200 rather than 301/302: the request is rewritten to index.html internally
# while the browser keeps the original URL, which is what lets React Router
# see /hot-wheels/bone-shaker instead of being bounced to /.
#
# This file has to end up in the BUILD OUTPUT, not the repo root — Vite copies
# everything in public/ into dist/ untouched, which is why it lives here.
/*    /index.html   200
